{"boundary":"Configured source-text signatures, not elaborated Lean or a complete dependency context. Truncation and unresolved names are explicit; full definitions and source remain on demand.","contributions":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 4"},"body":"Pinned source statements support the following navigation links.\n\nInspected: Configured challenge assertions, their relevant definitions and the cited audited paper statements were compared.\n\nEditorial revision by Codex, 26 October 2026: wording and display metadata clarified; pinned source texts and proposed relations unchanged. No human review or proof replay was added.\n\nCapture rebinding by Codex, 26 October 2026: the Atlas capture revision changed after an outside-report wording correction. The pinned Lean text, configuration, paper text and proposed relation are unchanged; no new review is implied.","content_sha256":"sha256:4762692861f977a62ae25459d05f4011d4fd08bbd89a5089edcabb492816328a","fingerprint":"sha256:eacb9023aeae711afd2438202222a68f1094e1adc731a1d45c33dfe09e56fad2","kind":"statement-link","license":"Apache-2.0","navigation":{"decision":"linked","limitations":"Agent source reading; no human approval, Lean replay or whole-statement equivalence certificate. Pinned source statements support the following navigation links.","schema":"statement-map-navigation-reading/1","source_sha256":"sha256:439f02fda8b7d65c54301a320565c07c0ebe8d02d53ec1354d943bd8e9caae96","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.PinchedHartogs.main_theorem"],"explanation":"MainTheorem constructs a nonempty open contractible domain in complex dimension three with a complete Kahler metric and real sectional curvature between -B and -A, 0<A<=B. NoBoundedCoordinates rules out a bounded holomorphic map to C^3 with nowhere-vanishing Jacobian, and the formal conclusion also excludes biholomorphism to a bounded domain. These are the paper main theorem conclusions.","fingerprint":"sha256:3f5bc4284bd88ac5fabbb84af17a5df6aebde2da5179cfefca48e996f0ed3816","general_disclaimer":true,"limitations":"This is an agent source reading, not a proof replay or independently reviewed equivalence.","relation":"same-claim","row_id":"A-negatively-pinched-Kahler-threefold-without-bounded-holomorphic-coordinates-September-25-2026#main:theorem","statement_sha256":"sha256:79cd88f8b23b93586aef31d6a28389725d2c65d908c7abb47658ad37a89a3ee8"},{"declarations":["OAI.PinchedHartogs.controlled_potential"],"explanation":"ControlledPotential supplies a smooth real potential on the complex two-ball with chart Hessian bounds using lower constant one, bounded chart jets, and no holomorphic real-part minorant beneath C+4*log(1/(1-norm(z)))+phi(z). These are the controlled-potential existence theorem hypotheses and obstruction, including the coefficient four. This link is to controlled_potential, separate from the final geometric construction.","fingerprint":"sha256:071aa8d76ef8b24ae2366bf15ec770ad02180af5c20f4172df4f59128eaf1b8a","general_disclaimer":true,"limitations":"This is an agent source reading, not a proof replay or independently reviewed equivalence.","relation":"same-claim","row_id":"A-negatively-pinched-Kahler-threefold-without-bounded-holomorphic-coordinates-September-25-2026#base:existence","statement_sha256":"sha256:740aef6f097947d72677e3e745d1e817a01c46b020f5b728e70974d9f04207fb"},{"declarations":["OAI.PinchedHartogs.metric_transfer"],"explanation":"MetricTransfer takes fixed positive chart-control constants c<=C and supplies a threshold lambda0 depending on those constants, uniform over qualifying smooth potentials. Above it the Hartogs domain is contractible and the prescribed metric is complete, Kahler and negatively pinched, with curvature constants allowed to depend on lambda. This matches the metric-transfer theorem.","fingerprint":"sha256:37300f95eb651b8863178ee7824d7478181cb7f1216d6e5eb689a136b45e897b","general_disclaimer":true,"limitations":"This is an agent source reading, not a proof replay or independently reviewed equivalence.","relation":"same-claim","row_id":"A-negatively-pinched-Kahler-threefold-without-bounded-holomorphic-coordinates-September-25-2026#metric:transfer","statement_sha256":"sha256:7e3406ea0583fea9a5eb063ae1e3e9c0a9fb23a449ad4160681cd340b9896f07"}]},"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","provenance":{"identity_assurance":"named local attestation; identity not independently authenticated","kind":"agent-drafted-unreviewed"},"references":["https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/PinchedKahler.lean","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-negatively-pinched-Kahler-threefold-without-bounded-holomorphic-coordinates-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L39","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-negatively-pinched-Kahler-threefold-without-bounded-holomorphic-coordinates-September-25-2026/build/sections/02-reduction.tex#L60","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-negatively-pinched-Kahler-threefold-without-bounded-holomorphic-coordinates-September-25-2026/build/sections/02-reduction.tex#L86"],"release_id":"openai-math","review_state":"unreviewed","row_id":"challenge:PinchedKahler","schema":"statement-map-contribution/1"}],"detail":{"path":"lean/332b31a9e98e37c1b4d0404a.json","pointer":""},"formal_statement":{"detail":{"path":"lean/332b31a9e98e37c1b4d0404a.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/332b31a9e98e37c1b4d0404a.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"kind":"declaration-signatures","method":"configured-challenge-declaration-signatures","name_resolution":"source-text","snippets":[{"complete":true,"detail":{"path":"lean/332b31a9e98e37c1b4d0404a.json","pointer":"/reader/selected_statements/0"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/332b31a9e98e37c1b4d0404a.json","pointer":"/challe